+# Audit 0.16.0: Earlier chips and the quick-settings tile
+
+Method: design review only (detector not applicable, native platform): impeccable critique
+(Android guidance: system surfaces, 48dp targets) and graphic-design-fundamentals §13, on
+`today_light`, `today_sleeping_dark`, `today_ptBR_light`.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals §13
+
+| # | Check | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | Log a sleep that began before you reached the phone, in one tap; Start sleep from anywhere. ✅ |
+| 2 | Concept | The row reads as a sentence: "Fell asleep 5 10 15 min ago". ✅ |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Under the one action, muted, small: secondary by design. ✅ |
+| 4 | Contrast | Meta text and hairline chips pass on surface and on the night panel. ✅ |
+| 5 | Alignment | The sentence starts on the card's left axis. ✅ |
+| 6 | Spacing | Tokens; 48dp targets around 32dp pills. ✅ |
+| 7 | Typography | Meta and body-small, one line. ✅ |
+| 8 | Colour | Outline only; teal stays the action. ✅ |
+| 9 | Consistency | Same pill as the chips elsewhere. ✅ |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Only valid chips appear; none when nothing makes sense. ✅ |
+| 11 | Real size | EN, PT, light, dark checked at phone width. ✅ |
+| 12 | Accessibility | Each chip spoken in full; the tile uses the system's states. ✅ |
+| 13 | Production | No new permission (the tile's service is guarded by the system's bind permission). ✅ |
+
+Fixed in this release: "Already asleep?" wrapped to two lines beside three chips; the row became
+one sentence ("Fell asleep … min ago" / "Dormiu há … min").
+
+## impeccable critique
+
+| # | Heuristic | Score | Note |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | System status | 4 | The tile is lit while asleep and says since when. |
+| 2 | Real world | 4 | The way a parent says it. |
+| 3 | Control | 4 | Undo-free but editable; times clamp to what is possible. |
+| 4 | Consistency | 4 | Tile and chips go through Entries like every button. |
+| 5 | Error prevention | 4 | Impossible times are never offered. |
+| 6 | Recognition | 4 | Visible, not a hidden long-press. |
+| 7 | Efficiency | 4 | One tap each. |
+| 8 | Aesthetic | 4 | Quiet under the action. |
+| 9 | Error recovery | 3 | Fix a wrong time in the sheet. |
+| 10 | Help | 3 | The tile's label and the sentence explain themselves. |
+| | **Total** | **38/40** | |
